#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:10
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:12
msgid ""
"This controller is a class compliant USB MIDI and audio device, so it can be"
" used without any special drivers on GNU/Linux, Mac OS X, and Windows. "
"However, if you wish to use the {ref}`ASIO sound API <preferences-sound-"
"api>` under Windows, please install the latest driver package available from"
" the [Support "
"page](https://support.hercules.com/en/product/djcontrolinpulse300-en//)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:20
msgid ""
"Firmware upgrade (v1.72) is required for pads to work correctly in **FX "
"Mode**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:22
msgid ""
"When using **Firmware v1.68** and earlier, pads in FX Mode will not work as "
"expected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:24
msgid ""
"For more details about [upgrading the "
"Firmware.](https://web.archive.org/web/20250329173925/https://www.djuced.com/change-"
"your-pad-fx-on-hercules-djcontrol-inpulse-firmware-update-guide/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:28
msgid "Sound card setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:30
msgid ""
"This controller has built-in 4 channel output sound card, with MAIN output "
"(RCA) and HEADPHONE output (3.5mm jack)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:33
msgid "Open **Preferences > Sound Hardware**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:34
msgid "Select the **Output** tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:35
msgid ""
"From the **Main** drop-down menu, select the audio interface, then "
"**Channels 1-2**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:37
msgid ""
"From the **Headphones** drop-down menu, select the audio interface, then "
"**Channels 3-4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:39
msgid "Click **Apply** to save the changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:42
msgid ""
"The {ref}`example setups section <setup-laptop-and-external-card>` provides "
"more details about the audio configuration in Mixxx."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_300.md:46
msgid ""
"The **Master** and **Headphone** knobs, as well as the    **Master** button "
"are hardware controls and interact directly with the    integrated sound "
"card’s output. Although they also send MIDI messages,    they have NOT been "
"mapped in Mixxx, so do not expect an on-screen    reaction when using them. "
"This was done to prevent the knobs to adjust    both the gain on the "
"controller’s sound card and in Mixxx."
msgstr ""

